        "img": "icons/svg/mystery-man.svg",
        "system": {
          "description": "<p>This hand-shaped bot scurries like a spider. It functions as a detachable hand for a cyberarm, though it is sometimes used by uplifts or other morphs who need a hand design for certain tasks. Its &ldquo;legs&rdquo; are more articulated than human fingers and can rotate/ bend in any direction. Though this bot does not have the leverage of a full arm/body behind it, it can extend a meter-long brace for stabilization and support.</p>",
          "reference": "Eclipse Phase Second Edition p. 348",
