      "effects": [],
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Your conduct or moods are modified. This may be due to conditioning and reprogramming via time-accelerated psychosurgery ▶294,\n      drugs, genetic tweaks, psi, or other factors. This may have been a\n      deliberate choice or it may have been inflicted against your will. \n      This trait may be taken more than once for different behaviors.</p>",
        "reference": "Eclipse Phase Second Editon p. 78",
